From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 19:55:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: script site, security id, window data, option index,
 string handlers (3253)

Members that were stubs now follow Microsoft's documentation:

- IActiveScriptSiteDebug: GetRootApplicationNode answers S_OK with NULL
  and OnScriptErrorDebug answers that no debugger is entered and the
  error is reported to the page as usual.
- IActiveScriptSiteWindow::EnableModeless tells the container.
- IActiveScriptSite::GetItemInfo accepts SCRIPTINFO_ITYPEINFO with the
  IUnknown request and gives no type information.
- The script host's IOleCommandTarget::QueryStatus and the text range's
  Exec answer OLECMDERR_E_UNKNOWNGROUP for a group they do not know.
- IInternetHostSecurityManager::GetSecurityId asks the security manager
  for the id of the page.
- ITravelLogClient::GetWindowData fills the address, anchor and title,
  and refuses javascript:, vbscript: and about: pages.
- IHTMLOptionElement::put_index accepts the value and stores nothing.
- A string given as an event handler is ignored in document mode 9 and
  later, so get_onclick reads VT_NULL; the todo_wine marks that now pass
  are removed.

diff --git a/dlls/mshtml/htmlevent.c b/dlls/mshtml/htmlevent.c
index a09ebb8..f547476 100644
--- a/dlls/mshtml/htmlevent.c
+++ b/dlls/mshtml/htmlevent.c
@@ -5452,8 +5452,16 @@ HRESULT set_event_handler(EventTarget *event_target, eventid_t eid, VARIANT *var
         VARIANT *v;
         HRESULT hres;
 
+#ifdef SG_MUTANT_MSHTML_EVENTSTR
+        if(0)
+#else
         if(!use_event_quirks(event_target))
-            FIXME("Setting to string %s not supported\n", debugstr_w(V_BSTR(var)));
+#endif
+        {
+            /* the handler is not set: a string is ignored in document mode 9 and later */
+            remove_event_handler(event_target, eid);
+            return S_OK;
+        }
 
         /*
          * Setting event handler to string is a rare case and we don't want to
diff --git a/dlls/mshtml/htmlselect.c b/dlls/mshtml/htmlselect.c
index fb7b530..c4c0d81 100644
--- a/dlls/mshtml/htmlselect.c
+++ b/dlls/mshtml/htmlselect.c
@@ -167,8 +167,14 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI HTMLOptionElement_get_defaultSelected(IHTMLOptionElement *
 static HRESULT WINAPI HTMLOptionElement_put_index(IHTMLOptionElement *iface, LONG v)
 {
     HTMLOptionElement *This = impl_from_IHTMLOptionElement(iface);
-    FIXME("(%p)->(%ld)\n", This, v);
+
+    TRACE("(%p)->(%ld)\n", This, v);
